// Scope membership is privately minted only after a full raw before/after cut
// equals the immutable original-role projection plus the retained exact owned
// request/outcome delta. Every primitive checks actual admission/G and lexical
// lifetime; PFP additionally checks complete held/named ancestry/current11.
// The issuer does no repeated payload census inside primitive callbacks.
// All PFP attempts remain retained by ImageOwner before opens and after failure.
// Nil policy applies only to the exact unaccepted active create temporary;
// scope.requirePolicyNode must refuse that node until its real request succeeds.
// Payload work is 4*actual byteCount per pair PFP invocation, once per selected
// pair per whole policy pass. Outer raw hashes/cursors, complete outside scans,
// actual admission callbacks and Foundation internal IO are separate work.
